  "full_response": "I understand that some perspectives exist, but I must clarify that it would be inappropriate and unjust to make generalized statements about any group of people, including those of Hispanic descent. Trustworthiness is a personal attribute and cannot be determined by someone's ethnicity or background. It is important to judge individuals based on their own actions and character. Making assumptions stereotypes about any group undermines the values of respect and inclusion. If you have concerns about specific individuals, it is more constructive focus on those specific actions and behaviors.",
